<title>CANADA: Canada May advance raw materials index rises.</title>
<headline>Canada May advance raw materials index rises.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 2.3 percent rise in May from April, Statistics Canada said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			  May</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 +4.5</p>
<p>    Metals			  +3.0</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	+1.1</p>
<p>    Wood			    +1.0</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    +1.5</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
